SUMMARY: Scarborough Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:Join the Farmers Market in their mission to bring affordable\
 , culturally appropriate\, local\, Ontario\, farm-fresh produce and uniqu
 e Artisanal products to the communities we work with in a spirit of ease\
 , cool comradery\, and heartfelt welcome!\n\nYou can click on the link: h
 ttps://linktr.ee/farmers.market https://linktr.ee/farmers.market to apply
  to the Farmers' Market Family for the 2026 Season!🌞\n\nThe Scarborough 
 Farmers' Markets\, welcomes Growers and Artisans that reflect the communi
 ties we serve and invite Vendors to join us in our mission.
