SUMMARY: Bike to School Week
DESCRIPTION:Green Communities Canada\, with support from the Sandhurst Ci
 rcle Neighbourhood Connections Project\, will be hosting a free Bike Fest
  on June 14 from 1:30–4:30 PM on the back field of Brimwood Boulevard JPS
 .\n\nThis drop-in event is open to all students in the community ages 4–1
 8. Participants will be able to enjoy a variety of activities\, including
  skill-building stations\, guided rides\, bike decorating\, and free bike
  checks provided by bike mechanics. Families will also have the opportuni
 ty to connect with the Sandhurst Circle Neighbourhood Connections Project
  team.
