SUMMARY: Sandhurst Circle Bike Festival
DESCRIPTION:This free community drop-in event is open to children and you
 th in the community 4 - 18 years old and welcomes riders of all skill lev
 els.\n\nParticipants will have the opportunity to enjoy a variety of fun 
 and engaging activities\, including:\n\n  * Free bike checks: Qualified m
 echanics from CultureLink Bike Hub will provide bike safety checks and tu
 ne-ups to help participants ride safely. Services may include tire inflat
 ion\, brake and gear adjustments\, chain lubrication\, and tightening loo
 se components. Repairs will be limited to quick fixes that can be complet
 ed quickly on-site. If more extensive repairs are required\, participants
  will be advised on next steps and referred to the Bike Hub for free addi
 tional support.\n  * Skill-building bike stations\n  * Bike decorating.\n
 \nParticipants will need to bring their own bike\, helmet\, and water bot
 tle. Note that electric bikes\, scooters\, or other electric equipment wi
 ll not be permitted at the event.
