SUMMARY: Scam Prevention - Wisdom for Independent Safety and Empowerment 
 防騙常識講座
DESCRIPTION:Scam Prevention - Wisdom for Independent Safety and Empowerme
 nt (WISE)\n\nA Free Community Workshop for Modern Seniors hosted by Opera
  One Foundation\n\n愛心妙韻基金會主辦免費摩登耆英系列：\n\n實體防騙常識講座 智友同行 WISE\n\n當傳統詐騙遇上 AI
 ， 為甚麼我們會上當？\n\nSpeaker: Carol Lam\, Chinese Christian Mission Toronto Cen
 tre\n\n主講：Carol Lam\, 中信多倫多中心\n\n地點：多倫多愛靜閣社區中心\n\n12:00 pm Light lunch sp
 onsored by Lake One Culture Association (free)\n\n中午12時 : 輕食午餐由 Lake One 
 Culture Association 提供 (費用全免）\n\n12:30 pm Wisdom for Independent Safety a
 nd Empowerment (Presenting in Cantonese)\n\nWhat is Digital Scam? What is
  AI?\n\nAI Scam prevention\n\nSafety precautions\n\n中午12:30 : 科技學習與防騙教育課程
  (講座用粵語進行)\n\n什麼是電子詐騙？什麼是AI (人工智能)？\n\n提防AI 詐騙陷阱\n\n安全守則\n\n\n
