SUMMARY: Managing Screen Time for Parents and Caregivers
DESCRIPTION:Wondering how to manage screen time for your child? This work
 shop led by a Toronto Public Health nurse explores the benefits and impac
 ts of screen time. Look at recommendations of screen time for different a
 ges and how to model appropriate screen time behaviour.\n\nThis workshop 
 is for parents and/or caregivers. Children under the age of 6 are welcome
 .
